        <title type="html"><![CDATA[[WebExtensions] Chrome 152+ extension action badge text limit]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30386</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30386"/>
        <updated>2026-09-02T11:22:23.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Chrome 152+ throws an error when extension attempts to set action badge exceeding 100 bytes.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">Commit implementing this limit (with tests for <code class="notranslate">action.setBadgeText()</code>): <a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/8170d1b52c226e2550811aefdca87ec35ba496e9/hovercard" href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/8170d1b52c226e2550811aefdca87ec35ba496e9">chromium/chromium@<tt>8170d1b</tt></a><br>
That commit landed in Chrome 152: <a href="https://chromiumdash.appspot.com/commit/8170d1b52c226e2550811aefdca87ec35ba496e9" rel="nofollow">https://chromiumdash.appspot.com/commit/8170d1b52c226e2550811aefdca87ec35ba496e9</a><br>
Both <code class="notranslate">action.setBadgeText()</code> and <code class="notranslate">browserAction.setBadgeText()</code> are aliased to the same implementation <code class="notranslate">ExtensionActionSetBadgeTextFunction</code>, <a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/main/chrome/browser/extensions/api/extension_action/extension_action_api.h#L209">former on line 209</a> and <a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/main/chrome/browser/extensions/api/extension_action/extension_action_api.h#L367">latter on line 367</a>.</p>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">WECG discussion: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4051121461" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/960" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/webextensions/issues/960/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/960">w3c/webextensions#960</a><br>
Chrome tracking bug: <a href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/491158086" rel="nofollow">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/491158086</a></p>

]]></content>
