        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191840740?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #29241.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4064318473" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29241" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29241/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29241">#29241</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds a new compatibility entry documenting that <code class="notranslate">writing-mode: vertical-*</code> does not work on <code class="notranslate">&lt;th&gt;</code> or <code class="notranslate">&lt;td&gt;</code> elements on iOS Safari before version 17.</p>
<p dir="auto">The current data shows <code class="notranslate">safari_ios: "mirror"</code> which incorrectly implies full support from iOS 9+. In reality, table cell elements only received support starting from iOS 17.</p>]]></content>
